{"contract":"translation_contextual_v2","candidate_identity":"c234ee0cf8350b4433d5ff149629d74e75f89835a954755edddc2aba05d01fcd","verdicts":[{"revision_key":"a12d1530d5bc3eb7c511edda938d521c5746ae445f4d5bcc65fa3457455c4b74","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"a59837610249f6bf39f48a5154a7660093f4c0bb28fbcea150d882176abb653b","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"a6090c7e0ff64fe07c171f293dd89829a82a0f52eb4c2695b26795885ecd4ab2","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"a6fd631ea297a17cfbe144a33625581cfe82002e32be7925d0d753501d6480f4","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"aaaaf55ee42b1211ea13f5774bbd7da7f546fb6094e3ed3a665ff6c7e8299758","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"The source says demonologists use demonic powers for their own purposes, 'often evil', with a few using them to fight demons. The target '无尽善恶' ('whether good or evil') loses that assessment and wrongly makes good and evil sound equally common, so the contrast with the 'a few' clause is gone. Source: tome-ashes-urhrok/data/birth/corrupted.lua:117 (source version not pinned)."},{"revision_key":"aad36f17ae78ee92924cef6db0c28308498697266fcafd504337adbe3fb25758","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"ac2347dac63f10c6419ded57f88a48fa7dd29d4ef677cedff8c41def5ba8a23b","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"ae8c122720e449478226c4cbfdb8008debae940771e765b41c49ba67c9d8adfe","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"af350d83cb30500bfa62cddfb85e5326c3de3298511afeb913fe733bdc56b552","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"af918013e6cf6b7daf714e7f0faf1fe8395ad38381770ebd71a9dbccc92a44e2","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"The source says 'within a small range of up to %d grids'. In demonic-pact.lua action, the player picks a target within range=getRange (tg.range=rad), then teleportRandom(x,y,radius). The target '传到 %d 码外的一个位置' reads as a fixed distance of %d and drops the upper limit 'up to'. It also drops 'random demon from your seeds' (the demon is taken with rng.table(list) from the equipped seeds). Source: tome-ashes-urhrok/data/talents/corruptions/demonic-pact.lua:846-895 (source version not pinned)."},{"revision_key":"b281c0e29d35a97aecb933c05774c01b4e7bdb90350c270a38768b3adcdae433","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"b2c260c3306354a426ab5cbdf7286fd30d13170abbf19d728022559404dc458d","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"b3497840432c8a83ff9f5fa38f2c3242f4d00fed7cd64d62a710d2a847faff23","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"OSMOSIS_REGEN is a heal-over-time effect: subtype heal, and on_timeout calls self:heal(eff.power/eff.dur); its long_desc reads 'You regenerate a total of %0.2f life'. 'Regeneration' should be rendered as regeneration or recovery. The target '渗透吸收' calls it absorption, which confuses it with the damage absorption of the Osmosis Shield talent (doom-shield.lua). Source: tome-ashes-urhrok/data/timed_effects.lua:521-556 (source version not pinned)."}]}